WEBVTT

00:03:27.630 --> 00:03:31.130
kids are sitting outside
the local library or the local McDonald's

00:03:31.163 --> 00:03:32.330
to do their homework.

00:03:32.363 --> 00:03:36.497
And it's just so unfair.

00:03:36.530 --> 00:03:37.763
BF: It's unacceptable.

00:03:37.797 --> 00:03:40.863
CH: Unacceptable.
Unacceptable is the right word.

00:03:41.297 --> 00:03:44.297
It also affects the businesses, right?

00:03:44.297 --> 00:03:47.530
Farming as a business

00:03:47.563 --> 00:03:50.297
because there's so much
technology being used.

00:03:50.797 --> 00:03:51.997
BF: Well, there is.

00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:53.697
So oftentimes I'm at an event

00:03:53.730 --> 00:03:56.030
and they're talking
about all this cool new tech.

00:03:56.063 --> 00:03:58.563
And listen, I just say
we use satellite technology,

00:03:58.597 --> 00:04:01.130
we have big data, data and analytics,